This directory includes materials used by various .help patchers, abstractions, etc. in the Litter Power Package.You can look and touch, but if you move things around, you might break something.Contents========lp.doom.mxb		Abstraction to determine what the host platform islp.grabprobs.mxb	Abstraction used to extract statistical properties from RNGslp.messages.help	Patch describing messages common to most Litter Power objectslp.pfft.frimWrap	Used by Spectral Mutation X-amplelp.rain.midi		Used by lp.vim.help